WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.053 --> 00:00:04.965
Mole went into another room with Rat.

2
00:00:04.966 --> 00:00:08.609
Toad and Badger sat at the table.

3
00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:13.576
"Mole played a smart trick," said Badger.

4
00:00:13.577 --> 00:00:17.703
"Why is Mole so smart?" said Toad.

5
00:00:17.704 --> 00:00:21.302
"He put on a dress and told some lies.

6
00:00:21.303 --> 00:00:24.706
What's clever about that?"

7
00:00:24.707 --> 00:00:29.169
"Mole scared the ferrets," said Badger.

8
00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:33.283
"He said a hundred badgers will attack."

9
00:00:33.284 --> 00:00:35.652
"Yes," said Toad.

10
00:00:35.653 --> 00:00:38.805
"But it's not true."

11
00:00:38.806 --> 00:00:43.924
"He said rats will come in boats," said Badger.

12
00:00:43.925 --> 00:00:46.086
"Yes," said Toad.

13
00:00:46.087 --> 00:00:49.107
"That's not true either."

14
00:00:49.108 --> 00:00:54.081
"And a gang of toads will strike," said Badger.

15
00:00:54.082 --> 00:00:59.189
"Yes, but . . ." said Toad, scratching his head.

16
00:00:59.190 --> 00:01:03.227
Suddenly Toad understood.

17
00:01:03.228 --> 00:01:07.880
"The badgers will attack from the barn!" he said.

18
00:01:07.881 --> 00:01:13.196
"The rats will attack from the river," said Badger.

19
00:01:13.197 --> 00:01:19.205
"The toads will attack from the garden!" said Toad.

20
00:01:19.206 --> 00:01:24.617
"Exactly!" said Badger. "The ferrets . . ."

21
00:01:24.618 --> 00:01:29.646
". . . will guard the wrong places!" cried Toad.

22
00:01:29.647 --> 00:01:33.869
Just then Mole and Rat came back.

23
00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:38.982
They held lots of weapons in their arms.

24
00:01:38.983 --> 00:01:44.715
"Mole," said Toad, "you are as clever as I am!"

25
00:01:44.716 --> 00:01:49.607
"Thank you, Toad," Mole said, surprised.

26
00:01:49.608 --> 00:01:52.801
Mole put down his weapons.

27
00:01:52.802 --> 00:01:58.154
"Now," said Mole, "tell me all your adventures!"

28
00:01:58.155 --> 00:02:01.404
Toad smiled happily.

29
00:02:01.405 --> 00:02:06.488
"When I saw that car, I wanted it," Toad began.

30
00:02:06.489 --> 00:02:10.395
Then he told his whole story.

31
00:02:10.396 --> 00:02:16.237
And Mole was very happy to listen.

